        "title": "Center Display May Not Show the Rearview Camera Image (Recall 25V-246)",
        "description": "NHTSA recall 25V-246 covers certain 2023-2025 Dodge Hornet vehicles. Cold soldering at a display voltage regulator and/or a display-microprocessor software defect can prevent the rearview camera image from appearing at the start of a backing event.",
